Nothing below has been run: this session has no shell, so these are the calls and messages in the order I would make them. `REPO=/Users/alexeysilver/work/ccs.ansible`; `$SCRATCH` and `$ORCH_INBOX` are my existing scratch and inbox; `T-WG` and `T-RDP` stand for the real backlog ids; `<…>` values come from command output. Operator-facing text is in Russian per the operator's ruling of 2026-09-21, with an English gloss.

