## 4. RDP audio, stage 0 — two product advisors, no executor

Bash, foreground:

```bash
mkdir -p "$SCRATCH/brainstorm/rdp-audio"
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd "$SCRATCH/brainstorm" --label prod-codex --no-focus
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd "$SCRATCH/brainstorm" --label prod-fable --no-focus
codex plugin list | grep -F superpowers; claude plugin list | grep -F superpowers
herdr agent start prod-codex --kind codex --pane <pane_id> --timeout 120000 -- \
  -m gpt-6-astra -c model_reasoning_effort=xhigh -s workspace-write -a never --search
herdr agent start prod-fable --kind claude --pane <pane_id> --timeout 120000 -- \
  --model claude-fable-5-1 --effort xhigh --name prod-fable
herdr agent read adv-codex --source visible; herdr agent read adv-fable --source visible
```

- If the skill check is empty for a CLI, that tab gets no brief and the operator gets a poll to install it.
- A voting advisor at 50% context or more gets `/compact` now, while idle.

The round-1 brief goes to `$SCRATCH/brief-rdp-audio-r1-prod-codex.txt`; the `prod-fable` copy differs only in "B" and `draft-fable.md`:

```
